    <briefdescription>
<para>Provides lookup and iteration over an on disk hash table. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This needs an <computeroutput>Info</computeroutput> that handles reading values from the hash table&apos;s payload and computes the hash for a given key. This should provide the following interface:</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keyword">class<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">ExampleLookupInfo<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">public</highlight><highlight class="normal">:</highlight></codeline>
